    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <description><![CDATA[Peek is a tiny native Windows utility that answers three focused system questions:

* Ghost captures short-lived processes and flashing windows.
* Unlock identifies processes that hold a file open.
* Focus inspects the Win32 and UI Automation element under the pointer.

Peek is a portable C++/Win32 application. It runs offline without accounts, telemetry, a web runtime, or an additional framework. The interface supports English and Simplified Chinese.]]></description>
    <summary>Tiny native Windows utility for transient processes, file locks, and UI inspection.</summary>
    <releaseNotes>Initial public release. Includes Ghost, Unlock, Focus, tray controls, global hotkeys, and English/Chinese UI. See https://github.com/HaBaDEDE/Peek/releases/tag/v0.1.0</releaseNotes>
    <copyright>Copyright (c) 2026 HaBaDEDE</copyright>
    <tags>peek windows win32 native portable utility process-monitor file-lock file-unlocker ui-automation</tags>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
